{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "parkia-cube-net-app-api",
    "name": "Parkia.Cube net_app HTTP API",
    "description": "Parkia.Cube `net_app` HTTP API（mongoose）。\n\n## 导入（两个标准文件）\n1. Postman → Import\n2. **同时选中** 本目录两个文件：\n   - `Parkia.Cube.postman_collection.json`\n   - `Parkia.Cube.postman_environment.json`\n3. 右上角 Environment 选择 **Parkia.Cube Device**\n\n## 使用\n- SoftAP：`base_url=http://192.168.4.1`；配网后改为 STA IP\n- **Wi-Fi 配网走 BLE**，本集合仅含 HTTP 管理接口\n- 已配网接口默认 Basic Auth（`basic_user`/`basic_pass`）\n\n## 约定\n- 路径无 `/api/v1`，如 `{{base_url}}/system/status`\n- HTTP 通常 200；业务看 JSON `code`（0=成功）\n- 详见 `app/net_app/API.md`\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "basic",
    "basic": [
      {
        "key": "username",
        "value": "{{basic_user}}",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "password",
        "value": "{{basic_pass}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "try {",
          "  const j = pm.response.json();",
          "  console.log(\"code=\", j.code, \"message=\", j.message);",
          "} catch (e) {}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. 状态 (open)",
      "description": "开放只读状态。Wi-Fi 配网请使用 BLE（见 app/net_app/API.md §1）。",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET system/status",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/system/status",
            "description": "网络摘要：provision_state / network_mode / ssid / ip",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"business code == 0\", function () { pm.expect(j.code).to.eql(0); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
